# PER4: the rig's span flipping 64, 32, 16, 8, 4, exact (every pixel), and back to 8,
# 0.267 s each, the divides marked at alpha 0.6 so the exact step shows the wall through
# them ("Why eight"). The window is frames 1464 to 1703, the rig's film seconds 24.4 to
# 28.4. The divide rig: e1m6's corridor from (504,500,242), a linear turn from yaw 104
# down at 0.778 degrees a second, no status bar, slop at 1920x1080. N2a, N2b, N2c and PER4
# are the same turn; the film cuts each where its line falls.

map e1m6

duration 40.1
fps 60
size 1920x1080
frames 1464..1704

preset slop
hud off
cvar gamma 0.8
cvar r_perspspan 8
cvar r_perspspan 64 at 25.4000
cvar r_perspspan 32 at 25.6667
cvar r_perspspan 16 at 25.9333
cvar r_perspspan 8 at 26.2000
cvar r_perspspan 4 at 26.4667
cvar r_perspspan 1 at 26.7333
cvar r_perspspan 8 at 27.0000

camera path
key 0     504,500,242  0,104.7778  ease linear
key 40.1  504,500,242  0,73.5889

divides on p244 width 1 alpha 0.6

sound off
events on
